 for the characters to befriend one another.\nHappy for pedestrians to be around to emphasise their size.\n\nSenna might be curious about Chacha's horns?\nChacha is a bit anxious from the attention but nevertheless happy.\nMary is pleased to meet Senna too, could you also arrange it so that Mary's tights/legs are more exposed and her dress is fluttering please.\n\nUltimately I would love Senna to be her friendly self and make friends with Chacha & Mary.\nI am happy for you to take some creative liberties.\n\nThank you very much", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@deruderu1379/works/5", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/d2cb4996/uploads/origins/dcb78dcf-4f07-4f9c-9078-f3c7d2317485?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=460974a6267f61fec0856389dbc5ceed", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/d2cb4996/uploads/origins/dcb78dcf-4f07-4f9c-9078-f3c7d2317485?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=460974a6267f61fec0856389dbc5ceed, https://si.imgix.net/d2cb4996/uploads/origins/dcb78dcf-4f07-4f9c-9078-f3c7d2317485?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=147c253eb8a6416c1b1d1538bdb57ed7 2x, https://si.imgix.net/d2cb4996/uploads/origins/dcb78dcf-4f07-4f9c-9078-f3c7d2317485?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=bed9787d552466db3bcdfd8920959577 3x", "genre": "art", "nsfw": false, "body": "if possible i would like to commission this time a cute picture of a giantess desco from disgaea trying to act like a kaiju in a city. Preferably in the arms raised rawring position. A more specific reference of the character is included below. The octobunny/ back peace of the character is not needed to decrease complexity.\n\nhttps://drive.google.com/drive/folders/1tCBedSl4YaBaM7oQ7tBdWkZSX1iSGiSc?usp=drive_link", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@deruderu1379/works/4", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net